  Auth --> AuthDB[(PostgreSQL)]
  Patient --> PatientDB[(PostgreSQL)]
  Appt --> ApptDB[(PostgreSQL)]
  Gateway -. tracing export configured .-> Zipkin[Zipkin endpoint configured; unavailable in smoke run]
